'''Age of Gods Golden Gate''' is a [[Light Cone Collaboration Warp]] in [[Version 4.4]].

==Event Details==
During the event, the drop rate of the limited 5{{Star}} [[Light Cone]], {{Light Cone Intro|I Am As You Behold}} will be boosted.

===Drop Rate Boost: 5{{Star}} Light Cone===
* {{Light Cone Intro|I Am As You Behold}}

==Notes==
* Among the above Light Cones, the limited Light Cone will not become available in the [[Stellar Warp]] event.
* During the Collaboration Warp period, the limited 5-star collaboration Light Cone "I Am As You Behold (Destruction)" can only be obtained from Light Cone Collaboration Warp "Age of Gods Golden Gate."
* "Kaleidic Coruscation," "Age of Gods Golden Gate," "Birth of a King," and "Red Radiance of Fuyuki" are considered Light Cone Collaboration Warps, and share the same guaranteed drop counter. The cumulative Warp count for a guaranteed 5-star Light Cone in any "Light Cone Collaboration Warp" will always be carried over to other "Light Cone Collaboration Warps," but is independent of and unaffected by other types of Warps.
* In this Light Cone Collaboration Warp, there are no featured 4-star rate-up Light Cones. The drop rates for all 4-star Light Cones are equal.
* This Collaboration Warp will be available for a long time, with no scheduled end date.
